    "PetalburgWoods_Text_HandOverThosePapers": "You! DEVON RESEARCHER!\\pHand over those papers!$",
    "PetalburgWoods_Text_YouHaveToHelpMe": "Aiyeeeh!\\pYou're a POKéMON TRAINER, aren't you?\\nYou've got to help me, please!$",
    "PetalburgWoods_Text_NoOneCrossesTeamAqua": "Hunh? What do you think you're doing?\\nWhat, you're going to protect him?\\pNo one who crosses TEAM AQUA\\ngets any mercy, not even a kid!\\pCome on and battle me!$",
